Question: Sorrento Therapeutics terminated its phase 2 COVI-MSC trial NCT04903327. Why did it stop, and were the results ever posted or published?

Snapshot date: 2026-11-05
Research notes: none

Findings:
[{"lane": "trials", "round": 1, "brief": "Review the registry status and facts for trial NCT04903327 (Study of Intravenous COVI-MSC for Treatment of COVID-19-Induced Acute Respiratory Distress), sponsored by Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc. The trial started on November 16, 2021, and was terminated on November 23, 2022, with 43 participants enrolled. The stated reason for stopping was: 'Due to considerably slow enrollment, unable to reach enrollment targets'. Results were due on ClinicalTrials.gov by August 29, 2023, but as of the snapshot, none were posted. Please verify if any results have been submitted or posted on ClinicalTrials.gov since the snapshot, look up the target enrollment compared to the final actual enrollment, and provide baseline statistics on trial termination and results reporting rates for context.", "findings": [{"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 (Study of Intravenous COVI-MSC for Treatment of COVID-19-Induced Acute Respiratory Distress) was sponsored by Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc., and had an overall status of TERMINATED.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed via snapshot and live record check."}, {"claim": "The trial started on November 16, 2021, and was terminated on November 23, 2022, with a primary completion date of August 29, 2022.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Dates match both snapshot and live record."}, {"claim": "The actual enrollment was 43 participants.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Target enrollment is not captured as a standalone column in the registry table schema, but the actual enrollment is recorded as 43."}, {"claim": "The stated reason for stopping was: 'Due to considerably slow enrollment, unable to reach enrollment targets', categorized under enrollment.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Categorized by keyword/llm as enrollment."}, {"claim": "Results were due on ClinicalTrials.gov by August 29, 2023, and as of the snapshot none were posted (1164 days late relative to the snapshot date/evaluation).", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Results are not posted."}, {"claim": "Live ClinicalTrials.gov check confirms that no results have been posted since the snapshot (has_results is false, results_first_post_date is null).", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Live check performed via get_trial_live."}, {"claim": "Across the snapshot base rates, 46.3 percent of stopped trials have no results posted, and 630 stopped trials are categorized under enrollment.", "evidence_ids": ["snapshot:stats"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Provides snapshot context for stopped trials and enrollment-related terminations."}], "gaps": []}, {"lane": "disclosures", "round": 1, "brief": "Search SEC EDGAR filings for Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc. (CIK 0000850261, formerly ticker SRNE) between September 2022 and September 2023. Search for mentions of the trial ID 'NCT04903327', 'COVI-MSC', or 'mesenchymal stem cells'. Review Form 8-K, 10-Q, and 10-K filings around the trial's termination date (November 23, 2022) and their Chapter 11 bankruptcy filing in February 2023. Determine how the termination, trial progress, or results of the COVI-MSC clinical program were explained to investors, and whether there are any discrepancies between the slow enrollment reason in the registry and the investor disclosures.", "findings": [{"claim": "Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc. sponsor CIK lookup and filings table in the snapshot are empty (0 rows), and live SEC searches failed due to environment configuration.", "evidence_ids": ["sql:f549949d", "ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "The snapshot contains trial NCT04903327 ('Study of Intravenous COVI-MSC for Treatment of COVID-19-Induced Acute Respiratory Distress') sponsored by Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc., with overall_status TERMINATED and why_stopped 'Due to considerably slow enrollment, unable to reach enrollment targets'."}], "gaps": ["SEC filings could not be retrieved because the snapshot filings table is empty and live SEC EDGAR API calls failed due to lack of configured SEC user agent in the environment."]}, {"lane": "publications", "round": 1, "brief": "Search PubMed and Europe PMC for publications linked to trial NCT04903327 or 'COVI-MSC' to find if any clinical results from the 43 enrolled participants have been published. The snapshot shows five review papers (PMIDs: 38005826, 35321737, 35897770, 35782071, 34831101) that mention the trial but do not appear to be primary results publications. Check if a peer-reviewed article containing the actual trial outcomes has been published, and if so, retrieve its date, journal, title, and key clinical findings.", "findings": [{"claim": "Five review publications (PMIDs: 34831101, 35321737, 35782071, 35897770, 38005826) mention trial NCT04903327 via Europe PMC text mining or drug/trial mentions, but none are primary results publications for this trial.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:34831101", "pubmed:35321737", "pubmed:35782071", "pubmed:35897770", "pubmed:38005826"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "All five linked records are review articles discussing stem cell therapies for COVID-19."}, {"claim": "No dedicated primary peer-reviewed clinical results publication reporting the outcomes of the 43 participants in trial NCT04903327 was found in PubMed or Europe PMC.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:34831101", "pubmed:35321737", "pubmed:35782071", "pubmed:35897770", "pubmed:38005826"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Searches returned only review papers mentioning the trial or drug name."}], "gaps": ["Primary trial results may exist in conference abstracts, preprints, or company registries not indexed in PubMed/Europe PMC."]}, {"lane": "disclosures", "round": 2, "brief": "Retrieve and review SEC filings for Sorrento Therapeutics, CIK 0000850261, from September 2022 to September 2023. Search specifically for Form 10-K, 10-Q, and 8-K filings referencing NCT04903327, COVI-MSC, or mesenchymal stem cells around the trial termination in November 2022 and the bankruptcy filing in February 2023.\n\n(Gap to close: SEC filings for Sorrento Therapeutics could not be retrieved in the first round.)", "findings": [{"claim": "Sorrento Therapeutics sponsored trial NCT04903327 (COVI-MSC for COVID-19 ARDS) which was terminated due to slow enrollment.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327", "sql:f549949d"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "ClinicalTrials.gov record shows overall status TERMINATED with reason 'Due to considerably slow enrollment, unable to reach enrollment targets'."}], "gaps": ["SEC filings could not be retrieved due to network tool execution failures (missing SEC_USER_AGENT configuration in the environment)."]}, {"lane": "publications", "round": 2, "brief": "Search bioRxiv, medRxiv, and broader indexes for any preprints, conference abstracts, or presentations containing clinical data or outcomes for trial NCT04903327 or COVI-MSC.\n\n(Gap to close: Primary results were not found in PubMed or Europe PMC but might reside in preprints or meeting abstracts.)", "findings": [{"claim": "Five publications were found linked to trial NCT04903327 via Europe PMC text mentions of the trial ID or drug name, but all are general review or systemic review articles mentioning mesenchymal stem cells or COVI-MSC rather than primary trial result reports.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:34831101", "pubmed:35321737", "pubmed:35782071", "pubmed:35897770", "pubmed:38005826"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "All five publications are review articles (e.g., 'Molecular Mechanisms of Multi-Organ Failure in COVID-19 and Potential of Stem Cell Therapy', 'Mesenchymal stem/stromal cell therapy for COVID-19 pneumonia: potential mechanisms, current clinical evidence, and future perspectives') that mention NCT04903327 or COVI-MSC as part of broader literature or registry discussions, and do not report primary clinical trial results or outcomes for this specific trial."}], "gaps": ["No primary results publications, preprints, or meeting abstracts specific to trial NCT04903327 were found in PubMed or Europe PMC. Further searches in specialized preprint servers (bioRxiv, medRxiv) or conference proceedings may be needed to locate missing primary outcomes."]}]

